{
  "info": {
    "name": "CEL-8373-followup — Missing change-password confirmation email (local repro)",
    "description": "Reproduces (and later verifies the fix for): grant_type=change_password on the gateway, proxied to celesta-auth, never dispatches the change_password_confirmation TransactionalEmailJob. Run against a local docker-compose.dev.yml stack (celesta-gateway, celesta-auth, celesta-crm, celesta-backoffice, celesta-contact, all on master). Import with No environment — dev defaults are baked in as collection variables. Steps 4-5 (drain the SQS queue, verify email_history) are NOT in this collection — Postman/Newman is HTTP-only and can't run docker exec or read SQS directly. See the .md for those two manual steps.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:93",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "playerEmail",
      "value": "casino+casino@gmail.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "resetToken",
      "value": "TEST_TOKEN",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "newPassword",
      "value": "NewPassw0rd!Repro1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "player_access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Application Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get application token (client_credentials)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/oauth/2.0/token",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "2.0",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response has access_token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Forgot Password (real trigger)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /forgot-password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "{{playerEmail}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Real entry point a player uses to request a reset. This DOES regenerate li_customer.temporary_password_token server-side (confirmed empirically) to a random value we have no HTTP way to read back. Folder 3 therefore still uses {{resetToken}} (the known dev fixture 'TEST_TOKEN', reset via the manual SQL step in the how-to doc's Setup) rather than whatever this call just generated — that's the only way to keep the collection self-contained and repeatable without a DB read. If you want to exercise the truly real token end-to-end once, read it manually after this request (SQL in the .md) and paste it into the resetToken variable before running folder 3."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Change Password (the call that should send the confirmation email)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /oauth/2.0/token grant_type=change_password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "change_password",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{resetToken}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{newPassword}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "deviceInformation[ip]",
                  "value": "127.0.0.1",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "deviceInformation[userAgent]",
                  "value": "Mozilla/5.0 postman-repro",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/oauth/2.0/token",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "2.0",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Real repro of the ticket: gateway proxies this to celesta-auth (internal/grant/change_password.go). That handler issues the token fine but never dispatches the TransactionalEmailJob the CEL-8373 plan required. This request always succeeds (200) — the bug is invisible here. Steps 4-5 in the how-to doc (drain the queue, check email_history) are what actually show it."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Response has access_token', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('player_access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "try {",
                  "    const payloadB64 = json.access_token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');",
                  "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(payloadB64));",
                  "    console.log('Issued token grant_type:', payload.grant_type);",
                  "    pm.test('Token grant_type is change_password', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(payload.grant_type).to.eql('change_password');",
                  "    });",
                  "} catch (e) {",
                  "    console.log('Could not decode JWT payload:', e.message);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}